3. **Residues.** Nb^d mod t is covered by the max over c. gcd(N, t) > 1 means a factor has been found.
4. **LV Lemmas 5.18–5.20 additive errors** must be ≪ ρ_F = L^{−O(1)}, not merely o(1).
