A hyperelliptic smoothness test. I
BY H. W. LENSTRA Jn1, J. PiLA2 AND CARL
1 Department of Mathematics, University of California, Berkeley,
California 94720, U.S. A.
2 6 Goldthorns Avenue, Kew 3101, Australia
